      ["ನಾನು ಕನ್ನಡ ಕಲೀತಾ ಇದ್ದೀನಿ.","nānu kannaḍa kalītā iddīni.","I'm learning Kannada.","The continuous: something going on right now or these days."],
      ["ನನಗೆ ಮದುವೆ ಆಗಿದೆ.","nanage maduve āgide.","I'm married.","Literally \"to me, marriage has happened\": the ನನಗೆ pattern again."]
