    "compare": [
      {"t":"mc","q":"'This is bigger than that' =","o":["ಇದು ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡದು.","ಅದು ಇದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡದು.","ಇದು ಅದುಕ್ಕಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡದು.","ಇದು ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಅದು."],"why":"'Than that' is ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ, and the adjective stays at the end."},
      {"t":"mc","q":"'This is cheaper than that' =","o":["ಇದು ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ.","ಇದು ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ಬೆಲೆ.","ಅದು ಇದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ.","ಇದು ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ."],"why":"Cheaper is ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ, and 'than that' is ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ."},
      {"t":"mc","q":"Ravi is older than me (about a man): ರವಿ ನನಗಿಂತ …","o":["ದೊಡ್ಡವನು","ದೊಡ್ಡದು","ದೊಡ್ಡವಳು","ದೊಡ್ಡ"],"why":"Ravi is a man, so the adjective takes the masculine -ವನು."},
      {"t":"mc","q":"'the best (of all)' =","o":["ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು","ತುಂಬಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು","ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು","ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು"],"why":"'Than everything', ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ, gives 'the most'."},
      {"t":"mc","q":"What does ಬೆಲೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಜಾಸ್ತಿ mean?","o":["The price is too high.","The price is very low.","It's very big.","It's the cheapest."],"why":"ಜಾಸ್ತಿ is 'more, too much'; ಬೆಲೆ is the price."},
      {"t":"order","p":"This is bigger than that. (start with 'this')","a":["ಇದು","ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ","ದೊಡ್ಡದು"],"x":["ಅದುಕ್ಕಿಂತ"],"why":"'Than' is a case ending after the noun, and ಅದು becomes ಅದ- before it: ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ, not ಅದುಕ್ಕಿಂತ."},
      {"t":"order","p":"Kavya is older than me. (start with 'Kavya')","a":["ಕಾವ್ಯಾ","ನನಗಿಂತ","ದೊಡ್ಡವಳು"],"x":["ದೊಡ್ಡವನು"],"why":"Kavya is a woman, so the adjective takes the feminine -ವಳು."},
      {"t":"order","p":"This book is better than that book. (start with 'this book')","a":["ಈ","ಪುಸ್ತಕ","ಆ","ಪುಸ್ತಕಕ್ಕಿಂತ","ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು"],"x":["ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವನು"],"why":"A book is a thing, so the adjective takes the neuter -ದು: ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"ಈ ಮನೆ ಆ ಮನೆಗಿಂತ __.","p":"This house is smaller than that house.","a":["ಚಿಕ್ಕದು","chikkadu"],"o":["ಚಿಕ್ಕ","ಚಿಕ್ಕವನು","ದೊಡ್ಡದು"],"why":"A house is a thing, so the adjective at the end is ಚಿಕ್ಕದು.","xr":["chikka","chikkavanu","doḍḍadu"]},
      {"t":"fill","q":"ಇದು __ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ.","p":"This is cheaper than that.","a":["ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ","adakkinta"],"o":["ಅದುಕ್ಕಿಂತ","ಅದಕ್ಕೆ","ಅದು"],"why":"'Than that' is the 'to' form plus -ಇಂತ: ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ.","xr":["adukkinta","adakke","adu"]},
      {"t":"fill","q":"ಇದು __ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು.","p":"This is the best.","a":["ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ","ellakkinta"],"o":["ಎಲ್ಲಾ","ಎಲ್ಲಿ","ಅದಕ್ಕೆ"],"why":"'The best' is 'better than everything': ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು.","xr":["ellā","elli","adakke"]},
      {"t":"type","p":"This is cheaper than that. (use ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ)","a":["ಇದು ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ","ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಬೆಲೆ","ಇದರ ಬೆಲೆ ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಕಡಿಮೆ","idu adakkinta kaḍime bele","adakkinta kaḍime bele","idara bele adakkinta kaḍime"],"hint":"ಇದು · ಅದು · ಕಡಿಮೆ · ಬೆಲೆ","x":["ಅದುಕ್ಕಿಂತ"],"why":"'Than' is a case ending after the noun, and ಅದು becomes ಅದ- before it: ಅದಕ್ಕಿಂತ.","xr":["adukkinta"]},
      {"t":"type","p":"He is older than me. (about a man)","a":["ಅವನು ನನಗಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡವನು","ನನಗಿಂತ ದೊಡ್ಡವನು","avanu nanaginta doḍḍavanu","nanaginta doḍḍavanu"],"hint":"ಅವನು · ನಾನು · ದೊಡ್ಡ","x":["ದೊಡ್ಡದು"],"why":"ಅವನು is masculine, so the adjective takes -ವನು: ದೊಡ್ಡವನು.","xr":["doḍḍadu"]},
      {"t":"type","p":"This book is the best.","a":["ಈ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು","ಈ ಪುಸ್ತಕ ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿದೆ","ī pustaka ellakkinta oḷḷeyadu","ī pustaka ellakkinta chennāgide"],"hint":"ಈ · ಪುಸ್ತಕ · ಎಲ್ಲಕ್ಕಿಂತ · ಒಳ್ಳೆಯ","x":["ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವನು"],"why":"A book is a thing, so the adjective takes the neuter -ದು: ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು.","xr":["oḷḷeyavanu"]}
    ]
